From: G Platform (round 7, gate time; main 2026-11-05)
Subject: unref the DB-probe timeout timer: each suite sat idle ~45 s after its tests

The reachability probe races the query against setTimeout(..., 45_000) and never clears or unrefs the timer, so
the process stays alive for the full 45 s after the tests finish (the probe itself answers in < 1 s). .unref()
keeps the same probe timeout but no longer holds the process open. No assertion changes. Measured on a TEST
branch, one suite per process: learner-db 45.4 -> 1.9 s, comprehension-db 45.2 -> 0.9 s, comprehension-w1c-db
45.2 -> 5.1 s, relational-db 45.2 -> 1.2 s (all still green). Batching / concurrency turned out unnecessary.

